    "progressSummary": "COMPLETED: sin_angle_mul_norms proved as lemma (0 axioms, 0 sorries). Chain: sin(arccos c)=sqrt(1-c²), scaled by N gives sqrt((1-c²)N²)=sqrt(cross²)=|cross| via lagrange_2d + Real.sqrt_sq_eq_abs.",
